WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.270
Two notes. That's all it takes.

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:03.850
Your friend knows the song,

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.650
and there goes your whole table.

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.690
That's Retro Glam Sessions.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.770
Each edition picks one decade.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.788
The live DJ builds the night

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.710
around that era.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.130
Come dressed for it.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.610
Meet your friends for a cocktail.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:17.448
Squeeze into a photo set

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:18.810
before the next record starts.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.608
We're planning the first night

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.530
in South Florida.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.288
Join the Retro Glam list

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.170
to hear which decade we're taking on,

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.380
where to meet, and when tickets open.
